---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | catchment.school"
  description="Privacy policy for catchment.school. What is collected, which third-party services are used and how to get in touch. School data is sourced from the Department for Education's GIAS service."
>
  <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6 flex gap-2">
    <a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a>
    <span>›</span>
    <span>Privacy Policy</span>
  </nav>

  <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Last updated: 31 October 2026</p>

    <h2>What data do we collect?</h2>
    <p>
      Postcode searches are processed in your browser. Your postcode is sent to the public
      <a href="https://postcodes.io" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">postcodes.io API</a>
      to find its coordinates. catchment.school does not log or store the postcodes you search for.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you use the email sign-up or the corrections form, the details you type (an email address and your message) are sent to the site owner.
      They are used only to send the updates you asked for or to reply to your report.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>postcodes.io</strong> - used to convert postcodes to coordinates for the school search. See their <a href="https://postcodes.io" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> - measures visits to the site. It may set cookies and collect standard usage data under Google's privacy policy.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> - the site is hosted on Cloudflare, which may collect standard server logs.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>School data</h2>
    <p>
      All school information displayed on this site is sourced from the Department for Education's
      <a href="https://get-information-about-schools.service.gov.uk" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">GIAS service</a>,
      which is publicly available under the Open Government Licence.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy-related queries, please use the <a href="/corrections/">corrections page</a> or read the <a href="/about/">About page</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
